{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "PreToolUse", "permissionDecision": "deny", "permissionDecisionReason": "dangerous-ops-guard [secret-exposure]: shell read of a credential-bearing path. Reference the single environment variable an integration needs; never print secret files. [command-sha256:14ceff85b6c9cbdb5dc3ec2f7200dee28b25f5ec913358079d531a725f25db19] If you truly intend this, run it in a shell outside the harness, or update harness/hooks/lib/dangerous_ops_guard.py to exempt the pattern."}}
